<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13236"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 27, 2005 - 10:47 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I know, I know...I find the dumbest stuff. <BR> <BR><a href="http://64.233.167.104/search?q=cache:bwr489EzzfkJ:www.greatestjournal.com/users/dark_skies/%2Bbtk%2Bdog&amp;hl=en" target=_top>http://64.233.167.104/search?q=cache:bwr489EzzfkJ: www.greatestjournal.com/users/dark_skies/&#43;btk&#43;dog&amp; hl=en</a> <BR> <BR>March 5th, 2005 <BR>Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind is a very good movie. we have BTK&#39;s dog in boarding at the vet. it&#39;s so old and not taken care of at all. it has sores all over its body. me and the other ward attendent gave it a bath. poor baby. <BR> <BR>I just thought I&#39;d mention it, in case a family member wanted to get him out.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13236-->
<!--Post: 13237--><!--Time: 1114625446-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13237"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Foxfire<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Foxfire<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 27, 2005 - 11:10 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Really.  I was concerned about the dog a little myself.  I cannot believe that his daughter or the mom didn&#39;t have somebody pick up the dog.  That&#39;s sad. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13237-->
<!--Post: 13247--><!--Time: 1114647835-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13247"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Affie4u<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Affie4u<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 27, 2005 - 5:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That is sad. Hwo could nobody have come for the family dog?!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13247-->
<!--Post: 13261--><!--Time: 1114701538-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13261"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, April 28, 2005 - 8:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Perhaps they are all perverts and we are feeling too compassionate for his family. They actually moved and did not take the dog or make accomodations for the dog? They just lost my sympathy and concern. That is inexcusable! They have provided insight into their family that they should have kept hidden. It is very dysfunctional to me.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 13261-->
<!--Post: 13285--><!--Time: 1114790382-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13285"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
